# The clients image's context is clients/. ProtoStrap tags the image from the context's
# git-tracked files minus these, so what's excluded here doesn't rebuild it (and a `!`
# re-include wouldn't be followed).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.angular
**/coverage
**/.vscode
**/.cursor
**/*.md
# Tests: `ng build` leaves out *.spec.ts, and the image runs no tests.
**/*.spec.ts
host/*.test.mjs
